{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/47cef75f00f82f96e65dcfb4a5a0afcb.avif?t=1761853169\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras_big/47cef75f00f82f96e65dcfb4a5a0afcb.webp?t=1761853169 width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Forget. Everything. And. Run. FEAR the Huntsman</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c6c70eb153561a5ea5e2eeb934da616.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c6c70eb153561a5ea5e2eeb934da616.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c6c70eb153561a5ea5e2eeb934da616.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience  one of humanity's most primal fears in Huntsman, a survival horror that will immerse you in the creeping dread and crawling terror\u00a0of arachnophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/9691e223865bb4f7092b2ffd7643d610.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/9691e223865bb4f7092b2ffd7643d610.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/9691e223865bb4f7092b2ffd7643d610.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new security guard at Atherton Laboratories, chaos erupts as\u00a0eight-legged predators infest the hallways. Outnumbered and defenseless, you must find a way to eliminate the threats and lift the facility lockdown to escape. Will you survive, or become the spider's next prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c18431825318c8b6a82c40da1b5055a.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c18431825318c8b6a82c40da1b5055a.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c18431825318c8b6a82c40da1b5055a.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the Web -\u00a0</strong>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/1000554b05844e45614d0c27c9a82fe4.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/1000554b05844e45614d0c27c9a82fe4.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/1000554b05844e45614d0c27c9a82fe4.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distract, mislead, and evade the deadliest creatures you've ever faced. Just remember: one wrong move, and you're prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/44bb241971a953b0d849cda45a7cff5a.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/44bb241971a953b0d849cda45a7cff5a.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/44bb241971a953b0d849cda45a7cff5a.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear Has Eight Legs -\u00a0</strong>Experience arachnophobia like never before! Each spider moves, hunts, and reacts with terrifying realism triggering primal instincts your mind won\u2019t be able to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814680?t=1761853169","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/54aa54ecfefe9a694528852c88e7ab1e5da242ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761853169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/a69783847121af70465fc540d1d1bbefcb45038b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761853169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/a69783847121af70465fc540d1d1bbefcb45038b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761853169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3967870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/47cef75f00f82f96e65dcfb4a5a0afcb.avif?t=1761853169\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras_big/47cef75f00f82f96e65dcfb4a5a0afcb.webp?t=1761853169 width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht