s infest the hallways. Outnumbered and defenseless, you must find a way to eliminate the threats and lift the facility lockdown to escape. Will you survive, or become the spider's next prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c18431825318c8b6a82c40da1b5055a.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c18431825318c8b6a82c40da1b5055a.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c18431825318c8b6a82c40da1b5055a.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the Web -\u00a0</strong>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/1000554b05844e45614d0c27c9a82fe4.poster.avif?t=1761853169\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/1000554b05844e45614d0c27c9a82fe4.webm?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/1000554b05844e45614d0c27c9a82fe4.mp4?t=1761853169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distra